INSERT OR REPLACE INTO Language_en_US(Tag,Text) VALUES ('TXT_KEY_CWC2_GUIDE_THECOVENANT_STRATEGY','Protect population, production and borders while learning five passages. Written on the Heart adds +1 Culture per city. An unaided review earns 10 Faith and 5 Culture multiplied by the era index plus one, at most once per game turn, including examinations.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Recall Revelation before moving starting units. Study its five numbered sections aloud, hide the text, then enter the reference and every section in order. The next four introductions cover the remaining passages. Settle, explore and defend normally; a Scriptorium supplies 2 Faith and 1 Culture.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Tabernacles supply 3 Faith and 1 Science with the Temple cost, technology, maintenance and prerequisite building classes. Recall rewards supplement infrastructure. Successful unaided reviews expand intervals to 2, 4, 8 and 12 turns; at most one ordinary review occurs per turn.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Use religious and cultural development for normal victory routes. Every tenth campaign turn requires all five passages in rotating order. Three consecutive unaided reviews mark mastery, but mastered passages remain in the review schedule. A failed or studied attempt resets that passage streak.');
